{"actor":"agent:orchestrator","data":{"field":"description","from":null,"to":"**BLOCKING BEFORE THE PUBLIC DEPLOY.** Raised jointly by MRQ-3 (which named it as owed follow-up) and MRQ-9 (which is currently shipping an unauthenticated admin route because of it).\n\n**The gap:** MRQ-3 merged real auth \u2014 magic links, sessions, bearer middleware, scope resolution, per-event reviewer scoping enforced down to a schema CHECK. MRQ-8 merged the API runtime. **They are not wired together.** `src/api/runtime.ts` names M-03 as the ticket expected to supply a `CredentialResolver` adapter; MRQ-3 deferred it as genuine follow-up scope rather than rush it.\n\n**The live consequence:** MRQ-9's `GET /events/:id/submissions` is **temporarily public**. SPEC scopes it to authenticated admins. On the private Forgejo deploy that is survivable; **on the public site it is an unauthenticated endpoint serving every submission in the conference**, including unpublished and rejected ones. That is the exact class of leak AC-214 exists to prevent, arriving through a different door.\n\nScope:\n- Implement the `CredentialResolver` adapter so the API runtime resolves a principal from MRQ-3's session cookie and bearer paths.\n- Reconcile `Principal` / `AuthContext` (they were designed in separate tickets and do not yet agree).\n- Extend `ApiBindings` accordingly; update the ~7 handler schemas that assume an unauthenticated context.\n- **Close MRQ-9's temporary hole:** re-gate `GET /events/:id/submissions` to authenticated admin scope, and convert MRQ-9's \"currently public\" test into one asserting a 401/403 for an unauthenticated caller.\n\nDepends on: MRQ-3 (merged), MRQ-8 (merged), MRQ-9. Hours: ~3. Workflow: inline-full. **Guardrail-adjacent \u2014 orchestrator hand-review at merge, and this ticket must be done before anything is deployed publicly.**"},"id":"ev_01KZQ6SNX4RRCEM06RFHETDX4C","provenance":{"reason":"Auth/API integration gap with a public-exposure consequence"},"schema_version":1,"task_id":"task_01KZQ6S7V29NQS43DZ4MDH559B","ts":"2026-08-11T01:25:38Z","type":"field_updated"}
